{
//Event 1
    "E01.001": "Okay, now we wait.",
    "E01.002": "Is it ready, Sam? Can it really fly?$h",
    "E01.003": "Totally. One hundred percent sure.$h#$b#I've launched countless bottle rockets when I was your age. Zero failures... so far.$0",
    "E01.004": "Hey farmer! You're just in time for the maiden voyage of the S.S. Vincent.",
    "E01.005": "Sam said if it goes high enough, maybe we'll get to visit the moon!$h",
    "E01.006": "Or at least we'll go visit the vending machine later. Same thing.$10",
    "E01.007": "I think it's gonna launch soon!",
    "E01.008": "...That was awesome!",
    "E01.009": "Mission success! Minor crash landing. Totally standard space procedure.",
    "E01.010": "Can I go look at the rocket?$0",
    "E01.011": "Sure, Vince.$h",
    "E01.012": "Yay!",
    "E01.013": "I'm not the best role model, but... I'm trying, you know?$10#$b#Vince deserves a little magic.",
    "E01.014": "SAM!",
    "E01.015": "Can we build an even bigger one next time?!$h",
    "E01.016": "Sky's the limit, buddy.$h",
    "E01.017": "Vincent says Sam is cool. I think he's okay. But he's not as cool as a real astronaut.", //Jas
    "E01.018": "Vincent told me he's building rockets now. I think it's wonderful he's using his imagination... I just hope Sam isn't encouraging too much chaos.", //Penny
    "E01.019": "Sam's gonna teach me how to build a real spaceship! He promised!$h", //Vincent
    "E01.020": "Rocket science is mostly about enthusiasm and duct tape. Trust me.$h",//Sam

//Event 2
    "E02.001": "Nah... That's not it.",
    "E02.002": "Whoa! @! I didn't hear you coming.$8",
    "E02.003": "I was just... messing around. Trying to get better at this.$10",
    "E02.004": "I'm working on writing something. A real song. Not just copying stuff from the radio.",
    "E02.005": "It's harder than I thought it'd be.$s#$b#Feels like... everything I come up with is too small.$s#$b#Like it's stuck inside my head and can't get out.$s",
    "E02.006": "I want to make something that sounds like a summer's day.$0#$b#Y'know... bright and fast and alive.",
    "E02.007": "I guess... even if nobody else gets it, it'd still be something that's mine.",
    "E02.008": "#'I'd love to hear it someday.'#'It's okay if it's not perfect.'#'Why don't you just play for yourself?'",
    "E02.009": "Yeah?$h#$b#I guess that gives me a good reason to finish it.",
    "E02.010": "You're right.$0#$b#Maybe it's better that way. Might be more real.",
    "E02.011": "I do.$0#$b#Sometimes it's enough.$7#$b#Sometimes it feels like it isn't.$s",
    "E02.012": "Well, it's nice to get some different advice for once.",
    "E02.013": "Most people around here just tell you to get a steady job and stop dreaming.$a#$b#It's good to know there's at least one person who doesn't think it's stupid.",
    "E02.014": "I'll let you know when I make progress on the song.",

//Event 3
    "E03.001": "Sam!",
    "E03.002": "Sam!! Are you okay??$s",
    "E03.003": "Yeah, buddy. Totally fine. This is... uh... all part of the plan.$10",
    "E03.004": "You could've really gotten hurt...$s",
    "E03.005": "I'm okay.$0#$b#I promise.",
    "E03.006": "I'll be more careful. I swear.",
    "E03.007": "...$s#$b#Okay.$s",
    "E03.008": "Come on, champ! I'll take it easy for the rest of the day, okay?$0#$b#You should go play with Jas a bit more before we need to go back home.",
    "E03.009": "Vincent sniffs and nods with a light smirk.",
    "E03.009X":"Hi, @. You should have tried to catch me.$h ",
    "E03.010": "That fall did actually hurt a little. I guess I'm not indestructible after all, huh?$0",
    "E03.011": "I used to think... nothing could really touch me, you know?",
    "E03.012": "But when someone's counting on you... you don't get to be reckless anymore.$7",
    "E03.013": "#'Vincent needs you around.'#'It's okay to fall sometimes.'#'Maybe stick to music.'",
    "E03.014": "Yeah...$s#$b#Trust me I know that. I'm not gonna screw that up.$7",
    "E03.015": "Yeah.$0#$b#As long as you get back up, right?$h",
    "E03.016": "Yeah...$0#$b#Guitars are usually less dangerous than skateboards.$0",
    "E03.017": "Still thinking about that crash.$8#$b#Not the fall... just what it would've meant if I didn't get back up.$s#$b#It's a lot of pressure, you know?$8",
    "E03.018": "Sam's my hero. He can fall down and still be the coolest!$h",

//Event 4    
    "E04.001": "Let's retry that...",
    "E04.002": "Okay... Let's try the bridge one more time.$0#$b#Just the transition into the chorus. And maybe keep it steady this time?$0",
    "E04.003": "No promises.$0#$b#I'm feeling chaotic today. Like a crash.$h",
    "E04.004": "*Chuckle*$7",
    "E04.005": "That's not... never mind. It's fine.$7",
    "E04.006": "I've got, like, fifteen minutes before I need to head back home. Let's just get through it once.",
    "E04.007": "Right. Okay. From the top of the bridge.",
    "E04.008": "One, two...",
    "E04.009": "One, two, three, four...",
    "E04.010": "Alright... cool. That was... something.$7",
    "E04.011": "We really nailed the 'trashy garage band' vibe right there. Very authentic.$h",
    "E04.012": "Yeah... We should probably meet for another session soon, guys.$s",
    "E04.013": "Sorry. I've got too much going on this week.",
    "E04.014": "Don't worry, Sam. You'll be famous someday. We'll be the 'we knew him when' story.",
    "E04.015": "Abigail and Sebastian pack up and leave.",
    "E04.016": "... I guess I care more about this than they do.$s",
    "E04.017": "I know it's just a band for fun. But music means so much to me.$s",
    "E04.018": "Band practice didn't really go the way I'd hoped... I guess we're all just in different headspaces right now.$s#$e#It's just hard when you care about something more than the people you're doing it with.$s#$b#Doesn't mean they're wrong. Just... different.$s",
    "E04.019": "Sam's trying to push the band on us really hard.$0#$b#I get it. He wants it to be something big.$0#$b#Not sure I'm built for that, though.$s",
    "E04.020": "Sam looked so serious at band practice, I thought he was about to start holding auditions.$9#$e#He's always had this dream, you know? I think I forget that sometimes, when I'm just messing around.$8#$b#We all want different things from the band. I just like having a reason to hang out.",

//Event 5    
    "E05.001": "Hey, @. I really didn't expect anyone to join me here.$0#$b#Not that I mind.",
    "E05.002": "Say... You originally come from Zuzu City, right?",
    "E05.003": "#'Yeah. I moved here from there.'#'I used to live there. If you can even call it live...'#'Yes. Why?'",
    "E05.004": "I grew up there.$0#$b#It was loud, fast... you could walk a block and see ten people chasing ten different dreams. I thought that was normal.",
    "E05.005": "When we moved here, I told myself it was temporary.$0#$b#Just 'til things got better.$0#$b#But then time passed.$7#$b#And I stopped waiting to leave.$s",
    "E05.006": "Now I've got this band, this music I really believe in... and I keep thinking about what it would mean to try for real.$0#$b#Like, really go after it.",
    "E05.007": "But every time I think about leaving, all I see is Vincent.$s#$b#Standing at the bus stop.$s#$b#Asking when I'm coming back.$7",
    "E05.008": "I see my younger self asking my dad the same question.$7",
    "E05.009": "Feels like I'm split in half sometimes.$s#$b#One part wants to get out and live something bigger.$s#$b#The other part... wants to be there for him and doesn't want to miss him growing up.$s",
    "E05.010": "Moving to Pelican Town is kind of bittersweet.$0#$b#Without it, I probably wouldn't have built such a strong connection with Vince.",
    "E05.011": "But sometimes I wonder if it's also holding me in place.$s",
    "E05.012": "#'You're allowed to want both.'#'Vincent will understand, eventually.'#'You're not stuck, Sam.'",
    "E05.013": "Yeah. I just haven't figured out how yet.$s",
    "E05.014": "Maybe. But he shouldn't have to.$7",
    "E05.015": "That's the dream.$0#$b#Still trying to believe it.$s",
    "E05.016": "Sorry. That got heavier than I planned. I just needed to let it out.$0",
    "E05.017": "Thanks for being here.",
    "E05.018": "I should head back. My mom gets upset when I miss dinner.$h#$b#Even when I make it, like, five minutes late.$10",
    "E05.019": "Sometimes I wonder what I'd be doing if we'd stayed in Zuzu.$s#$e#There's a lot I love here. Maybe that's what makes it so hard.$s",

//Event 6
    "E06.001": "Is it my turn yet?",
    "E06.002": "Nice to see you, @. Do you want to dry off a bit from the bad weather outside?",
    "E06.003": "Do you want to join our game? You can be the red piece!$h",
    "E06.004": "We could use another player. Sam said he might join, but he's been holed up in his room all morning.$s",
    "E06.005": "Sam! Come play too!$h",
    "E06.006": "...$7#$b#I would, but...$s#$b#I promised Sebastian I'd help him with something. I should probably go.$s",
    "E06.007": "Oh... okay.$s",
    "E06.008": "*Sigh* Robin told me Sebastian is pretty busy this week...$s#$b#@, would you mind checking on him?$s",
    "E06.009": "#'Of course.'#'But... I wanted to play the board game!'",
    "E06.010": "... Can you please check on him?$s",
    "E06.011": "#'Okay.'",
    "E06.012": "#'Helping Sebastian, huh?'#'Are you okay?'",
    "E06.013": "I didn't lie about helping Seb.$s#$b#I might just have left earlier than I had to.$s",
    "E06.014": "Not really.$s",
    "E06.015": "You ever walk out of a room and immediately hate yourself for it?$s",
    "E06.016": "Seeing my family laughing and having fun...$s",
    "E06.017": "Playing that game that barely makes sense because Vincent made up most of the rules.$s",
    "E06.018": "...$s#$b#But Vincent looked so happy.$s",
    "E06.019": "And all I could think was: 'I never had that. Not when I was his age.'$a",
    "E06.020": "It's like I missed out on something.$a#$b#Something I can't ever get back, you know?$a",
    "E06.021": "And I feel like I'm supposed to give that to him now.$s#$b#Like I owe him something better.$s",
    "E06.022": "#'You don't owe him. You care about him.'#'You're allowed to feel that way.'#'You could go back inside.'",
    "E06.023": "Yeah... I do.$s#$b#That's probably why it hurts.$7",
    "E06.024": "Doesn't make it any easier, does it? But thanks.$7",
    "E06.025": "... Maybe I could.$7#$b#Maybe next time. I'm just not ready right now.$7",
    "E06.026": "I want to be someone he can count on. Not just when it's easy.$7",
    "E06.027": "Thanks for checking on me.$0#$b#I don't know if I would've... snapped out of it on my own.",
    "E06.028": "Vincent's too young to notice when I mess up.$7#$b#That won't last forever.$s",
    "E06.029": "Sometimes I worry Sam puts too much pressure on himself.$s#$b#He doesn't have to be perfect. Just present.$s#$e#I'm trying to tell him that, but a 'man' his age doesn't seem to take advice from his mother well.$s",
    "E06.030": "Can you help me make Sam feel better?$s",
    "E06.031": "Why are you looking at me like that?$s#$b#What? I'm a really good father.$s",
    "E06.032": "What is up with Sam lately? Usually he is all talkative and stuff, but he's been so different the last few days.$0#$e#Abigail and my mother told me to talk with him about it... I don't know how to though...$0",

//Event 7
    "E07.001": "You ever think we should actually, like... finish one of our songs?$0",
    "E07.002": "Hey, we've finished three!$h#$b#That one where my guitar broke mid recording definitely counts.$0",
    "E07.003": "That was technically not part of the song.",
    "E07.004": "Uhm... Guys...$s#$b#I've been thinking, though... maybe I'll record a solo track. You know, just to see how it sounds.$s",
    "E07.005": "Sure. Let me know if you need help with the mix.",
    "E07.006": "Wait... solo? You're not ditching us, are you?$3",
    "E07.007": "No! No, nothing like that.$8#$b#Just... I've got all this stuff in my head.$s#$b#Feels like it's gotta go somewhere, y'know?$s",
    "E07.008": "Anyway, it's fine. I'm fine. Everything's fine.",
    "E07.009": "Abigail is looking at Sebastian, hoping he would say something.",
    "E07.010": "Uhhh...$0#$b#Do you need a beer, Sam?",
    "E07.011": "...$a",
    "E07.012": "Sam. Come on. You don't have to pretend with us. What's up with you?$s",
    "E07.013": "I don't know, Abby.$s#$b#I think I'm gonna head out. It's been a long day.$7",
    "E07.014": "I just need some air.$7",
    "E07.015": "Sam doesn't seem like he wants to be followed.",

    "E07_1.001": "Hi, @. You saw that too, right?$s",
    "E07_1.002": "Sebastian, you really blew that, you know.$a#$b#As his best friend, you should know better.$a",
    "E07_1.003": "I don't know what I'm supposed to do.$a",
    "E07_1.004": "@ is right. We shouldn't argue right now. Sam really needs us.$s",
    "E07_1.005": "He's been like that a lot lately.",
    "E07_1.006": "Yeah. I've noticed too.$s#$b#It must have to do with his little brother. I saw he stitched 'Vince' into the inside of his sleeve.$s",
    "E07_1.007": "Into his favorite jacket? I didn't know he could sew.$s",
    "E07_1.008": "It was easy to see, he used pink yarn to do it.",
    "E07_1.009": "I actually think he told me one time that pink is his brother's favorite color.",
    "E07_1.010": "Listen, I don't know how to help him. I'm sorry.$s",
    "E07_1.011": "You don't have to fix it. But maybe we should stop acting like he's always okay.$s",
    "E07_1.012": "Sam has a strong character. We can't be too pushy.$s#$b#He needs to figure it out himself. We can only be there for him and give him support.$s",
    "E07_1.013": "He specifically asked us to let him have some alone time.$0#$b#With him wanting to make a solo track and such.$0",
    "E07_1.014": "I'm pretty sure he knows what he's doing.",
    "E07_1.015": "Yeah... you're right.$s#$b#Let's give him some space. I'm sure he'll eventually open up to one of us.",

    "E07.016": "...$s#$b#%Vincent doesn't seem like he wants to talk today.",
    "E07.017": "Listen...$3#$b#I'll be fine I just need to figure stuff out.$0#$b#Thanks for checking on me.",
    "E07.018": "Don't worry too much about Sam. He'll ask for help if he needs it.",
    "E07.019": "...$0#$b##What?$0#$b#Sam? Sam will be fine. I also feel better after taking some alone time.",

//Event 8  
    "E08.001": "Hey. Cool seeing you here.$0#$b#I usually don't see many people here at this hour.",
    "E08.002": "Don't tell my mom that you found me here.$10#$b#It's not like she would be able to stop me, but I'd rather sneak out than make her worry.",
    "E08.003": "Anyway... since you're here...$10#$b#Would you mind if we talk a little?",
    "E08.004": "I've been thinking a lot lately.",
    "E08.005": "I spent years thinking my life had to be a certain way. Big stages, touring, chasing something huge.",
    "E08.006": "I used to picture myself on stage...$0#$b#I had it all planned. Me, Abby, Seb... the whole band, you know?",
    "E08.007": "We'd tour, record, get signed, live off gas station snacks and bad sleep. We'd make it work.",
    "E08.008": "But it's not real.$s#$b#Seb's got other stuff going on, Abby's in and out, and me...$7",
    "E08.009": "I've got a kid brother who watches everything I do.$0#$b#He needs me around. And I can't just vanish one day chasing a maybe.",
    "E08.010": "And maybe the music dream is not about being famous.$0#$b#Maybe it's about just making something I care about. Playing for the people who matter.",
    "E08.011": "You can see Sam blushing while facing away. He seems nervous, which you think is a bit out of character for him.",
    "E08.012": "Sometimes I wonder if that sounds like settling.$10#$b#But lately, the more I think about it, it feels less like settling and more like... choosing something real.$l",
    "E08.013": "It's just hard to figure out what real even looks like for me.",
    "E08.014": "I trust you more than anyone.$0#$b#So... what do you think? Is it okay to let go of one dream, if it means finding something better?",
    "E08.015": "#'Maybe your real dream was here all along.' (Romance)#'Dreams change. That doesn't make them less important.' (Friendship)",
    //Love
    "E08.016": "...Yeah. Maybe it was.$0#$b#And maybe... it was right in front of me.$l",
    //Friends
    "E08.017": "Yeah... guess that's true.$0#$b#But it helps knowing someone's got my back.$h",
    //same End
    "E08.018": "Whatever happens... I'm glad you're here.",
    "E08.019": "I feel more at ease lately. Like I finally stopped chasing my own shadow.",
    "E08.020": "Sam seems calmer these days. Maybe he's figured something out. Good for him.$0#$e#You're good for Sam. Don't tell him I said that, though.",
    "E08.021": "Sam taught me some chords on his guitar. Mom says I'm too loud, but Sam says I'm a natural!$h",
    
//Event 9
    "E09.001": "Oh! Hello, @. Great to see you.",
    "E09.002": "He's been out here watching the same snail for ten minutes. I think it's his new best friend.$h",
    "E09.003": "You're probably here for Sam, aren't you?$0#$b#He's inside, digging through his old stuff from the attic.",
    "E09.004": "He said he's 'finally being responsible,' which usually means he's just procrastinating on something else.$h",
    "E09.005": "Hey, @.$0#$b#I didn't expect company today...$0#$b#But you're not interrupting or anything.$10",
    "E09.006": "I was just going through stuff my mom made me take out of the attic.$0#$b#Apparently I've been 'hoarding memories like a raccoon.' Her words, not mine.$10",
    "E09.007": "You can see a wide array of notes, pictures, toys, old guitar picks, and a skater helmet.",
    "E09.008": "You ever go through old stuff and suddenly remember a different version of yourself?$h",
    "E09.009": "Do you remember when I told you that I've spent most of my childhood in Zuzu before moving here?$0#$b#Loud, packed, kinda smelled like train oil all the time? Yeah, that Zuzu.",
    "E09.010": "My mom used to bring me and Dad to Pelican Town for the festivals here every year when we lived there.$0#$b#I remember all the cool decor, the first time I participated in the Egg Hunt, and falling asleep in the backseat on the drive home.$0#$b#Pretty sweet childhood memories, I'm not gonna lie.$h",
    "E09.011": "When she found out Vincent was on the way, she told Dad it was time to trade the city's noise for the valley's nature.$0#$b#I thought she was being dramatic... but now?$7",
    "E09.012": "Seeing Vincent grow up happy like this...$0#$b#It makes me realize she was right with the move.$10",
    "E09.013": "Sometimes I wonder... If I'd grown up here too, how different I'd be.$0",
    "E09.014": "Huh?",
    "E09.015": "What is that?$8",
    "E09.016": "Sam found a piece of paper that did not belong with the rest.",
    "E09.016X": "Close image.",//referring to closing an image that is shown ;)
    "E09.017": "I... I didn't know he made this.$8",
    "E09.018": "Sam! I found a snail! It's yellow-ish and squishy and I named it Sluggy!$h",
    "E09.019": "You finally found it!",
    "E09.020": "I made it some time ago and hid it in your stuff to find!$h#$b#Do you like it?",
    "E09.021": "I love it, buddy.$h",
    "E09.022": "When you're done, you should come to see Sluggy!$0#$b#Better be fast before he's gone!$h",
    "E09.023": "It appears like I kinda already am a rockstar, huh?$10",

    "E09.024": "I still think about what it'd be like to play big shows... but I don't think I'd trade it for what I've got here.",

    "E09.025": "I think Sam really liked my drawing. He's smiling so much.",

    "E09.026": "That picture Vincent made?$0#$b#I think it meant more to Sam than he'll admit.$1",

//Event 10
    "Mail.SamInviteE10":"Hi @,^^could you please meet me in town by my house?^After 8 pm would be perfect! Thank you!^^    Hoping to see you soon,^    Sam[#]Sam's sus invite",

    "E10.001": "Hi, @.$0#$b#Thanks for showing up.$0",
    "E10.002": "I was waiting at the door ever since my mom went to bed to sneak you in.$h",
    "E10.003": "Come on, let's get to my room.$0",
    "E10.004": "Sam is holding your hand tightly while you both sneak into his room, making as little noise on the way as possible.",
    "E10.005": "Okay. We should be good to talk at normal voice level now.$0",
    "E10.006": "Listen... I am quite nervous.$10#$b#I wasn't sure if I'd actually go through with this.$10",
    "E10.007": "I've been writing something.$0#$b#Not for the band, not for a stage... just for you.$l#$b#Here goes nothing...$0",
    "E10.008": "...Yeah. That's it.$10#$b#Guess it's more of a 'song draft' than an actual song.$10",
    "E10.009": "But, uh... it's the first time I didn't care if it was perfect.$0#$b#Because the only person I wanted to hear it... was you.$l#$b#And it came from my not-so-perfect heart.$l",
    "E10.010": "#'It was amazing, Sam.'#'Even if it's not perfect, it feels real.'#[Stay quiet and just smile at him.]",
    "E10.011": "You mean it?$8#$b#Man, I think my heart just skipped.$l#$b#That means more to me than you know.",
    "E10.012": "Real...$3#$b#Yeah... that's what I've been chasing all along, isn't it?$0#$b#Not fame, not perfection. Just something real.$0",
    "E10.013": "Ahaha...$10#$b#You don't even have anything to say, huh? That smile says it better than words could.$h",
    "E10.014": "You know, when I was younger, I thought my whole life had to lead to one thing... to becoming some kind of rockstar.$0#$b#A big and loud legacy.$0#$b#Like if I could just make it, then I'd finally matter.$3",
    "E10.015": "But I've realized I don't have to disappear, chasing some dream, to be someone worth remembering.$0#$b#That's not what it's all about in life.$0#$b#That's not how I'll be truly happy.$0",
    "E10.016": "I really enjoy the life I have going on here and I can't imagine trading it in for anything else.$0",
    "E10.017": "And then there's you.$10#$b#Somehow, you saw me and... and you stayed.$0#$b#You became the companion on my journey I never want to lose.$l",
    "E10.018": "And I would love to stay by your side as well...$l",
    "E10.019": "So yeah.... That's the song. That's me.$10#$b#And what I'm really trying to say is... you're the best part of my story so far.$l",
    "E10.020": "...$l#$b#@... can I... can I kiss you?$l#$b#Or is that way too cheesy, right after a love song?$10",
    "E10.021": "#Kiss.#No kiss.",
    "E10.022": "No kiss? Oh... Okay... That's chill.$9",
    "E10.023": "I love you, @.$l",
    "E10.024": "Thank you for everything, @.",



}
